Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The components below are distributed alongside KHORS Desktop as separate
files. They are NOT part of the KHORS Desktop source code and remain under
their own licenses. KHORS Desktop runs the proxy cores only as separate
processes and does not link against them.

Component        License                    Source
---------------  -------------------------  -----------------------------------------
Xray-core 26.10.31 MPL-2.0                    https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
sing-box         GPL-3.0-or-later (*)       https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
sing-box-extended GPL-3.0-or-later (*)      https://github.com/shtorm-7/sing-box-extended
Wintun           Prebuilt Binaries License  https://www.wintun.net

(*) Check the additional terms in the sing-box LICENSE (use of the project
    name) before each release. The exact sing-box version shipped and a link
    to its corresponding source are listed in tools/cores/cores.lock.json.

Cores updated from the application (Settings → Cores) are the official
release builds of the same projects, downloaded from their GitHub Releases
together with their LICENSE files; the source of each version is the
matching tag in the project repository (for example,
https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/tree/v1.14.3).

